\fBBarChart\fR: series over categories as bars, grouped, stacked or to 100%, vertical or horizontal. A \fBHistogram\fR is a bar chart whose bars touch.
.SH CONSTRUCTORS
.TP
.B BarChart::new(categories: impl IntoIterator<Item = impl Into<String>>, series: impl IntoIterator<Item = Series>)
One label per category and one \fBSeries\fR per bar of a group.
.TP
.B BarChart::histogram(h: &Histogram)
A histogram: one series of counts, bars that (almost) touch, labeled by where each bin starts.
