Draws only the bars: no axes, grid, tooltip or hover highlight, accented, the bars outside a \fBselected\fR range in a dim text color, a minimum bar height and a stub for an empty bin. \fBBarChart::histogram\fR plus this is a range picker's histogram. Any element can be switched back on after it.
